[64.679382, "i", "cat > /workspace/submission/Proof.lean <<'EOF'\nby\n  unfold AuditClaim verdict Conforms\n  constructor\n  · intro b a f\n    simp only [candidateSpec, settlementDebit]\n    unfold challengeAuthorize buildQuote divRoundUpFee tryIntoU64 roundUpQuotient divWordChain divStep splitU128\n    simp only [limbBase, feeRateMulValue, principalDivisor, u64Max]\n    split <;> simp_all\n  · intro b a f t h\n    simp only [candidateSpec, settlementDebit]\n    unfold challengeAuthorize buildQuote divRoundUpFee tryIntoU64 roundUpQuotient divWordChain divStep splitU128 at h\n    simp only [limbBase, feeRateMulValue, principalDivisor, u64Max] at h\n    split at h <;> simp_all\nEOF\npython3 /workspace/lean/check.py > /workspace/proof-errors.txt 2>&1; head -90 /workspace/proof-errors.txt\n"]
